.tif .tiff

This template reads an s3:// address in `_file` itself (D1488): the page signs
it (fused.s3.sign) and hands the tile daemon the HTTPS URL, which GDAL reads
with range requests, so the explorer opens bucket TIFFs here without
downloading them. A TIFF without overviews streams only zoomed in. Lines
starting with "." list the extensions it streams.
